{%- comment -%}
  Womankind — solution-aware editorial listicle (focus: hot flashes).
  "10 Reasons Your Hot Flashes Won't Quit — And Why This Zero-Sugar Gummy Is Different"
  Byline: Sarah Ellison, WHNP (same narrator as the advertorial). Self-contained:
  brand fonts via wk-fonts, scoped reset under #wk-{{ section.id }}, 'womankind' layout.
